Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(mcp): add_operation for the Wire Contour (no tool),
 list_operation_types mounts_tool

add_operation takes tool as optional for a kind that mounts no library tool;
list_operation_types states mounts_tool per kind; camcraft-mcp skill gains
the Wire Contour; PROCESS_VERSION 18.

Fixes #1108

